          "default": null,
          "description": "FX path: entity.column, or prefixed fx_rule:, fx_column:, fx_table:. May be followed by ``;<modifier>=<value>`` pairs. ``cast=double`` is an abstract hint for per-row fx_column multiplication (see contract_semantics). For ``fx_table:<physical_table>``, ``as_of=<entity.column>`` is required (valuation date on the metric's join path); optional ``quote=USD`` (default USD at runtime if omitted), ``base=USD`` (identity / same-currency rows), and ``rate_date_col`` / ``base_currency_col`` / ``quote_currency_col`` / ``rate_col`` when the FX table does not use the standard names rate_date, base_currency, quote_currency, rate.",
          "title": "Normalization Ref"
